# The cheat screen (docs/port/QA.md 2): the main menu's cheat code (the cartridge's: hold L, press Z) makes its
# option 6 valid, five down reach it, A opens the cheat screen (0x8000000); there cheat 0's code (hold R and press
# Z, hold C-up and press Z) and RIGHT switch it, and B goes back to the main menu.
# until: 0x10:700
# seconds: 60
# visits: 0x8000000
# expect: state=0x00000010: players 1, windows 1
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt; the main menu from 8 s
10 L 0.6       # the main menu's cheat code
10.3 Z 0.1
12 DOWN 0.1    # five down: 1-4, then 6, the cheats
12.5 DOWN 0.1
13 DOWN 0.1
13.5 DOWN 0.1
14 DOWN 0.1
15 A           # the cheat screen
18 R 0.4       # cheat 0's code
18.2 Z 0.1
18.8 CU 0.4
19.0 Z 0.1
20 RIGHT 0.1   # switch it
22 B           # back to the main menu
